  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is the&nbsp;constant of integration, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to _________.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p>",
